window.EXAUD={"Please accept this small gift from our class.": "audio/cau/86e7a0b4e2454140.mp3", "Lan accepted the invitation, but Minh refused it.": "audio/cau/ac6f7b1f73f4208f.mp3", "Hoa is always polite when she talks to adults.": "audio/cau/30f664238e37dbc6.mp3", "Adults need about eight hours of sleep.": "audio/cau/965ef8331141619a.mp3", "I agree with you about the park.": "audio/cau/f2a726fc02481cb5.mp3", "Nam agrees with the plan, but Mi disagrees.": "audio/cau/15f7b23e7c7063cd.mp3", "We reached an agreement after the talk.": "audio/cau/1544b408c62fc15c.mp3", "She nodded in agreement.": "audio/cau/4c9349a25fbbf77c.mp3", "The two sisters look alike.": "audio/cau/adc5d16e3a95923c.mp3", "No two people are exactly alike.": "audio/cau/bd46ef9712c752ec.mp3", "We must keep our traditional crafts alive.": "audio/cau/461c910cfd0f1264.mp3", "The old tree is still alive, but that one is dead.": "audio/cau/713514d344b69a38.mp3", "She lives alone in a small flat.": "audio/cau/13d2d43093d9ae4b.mp3", "Don't go to the river alone.": "audio/cau/3571f8f1b5688fca.mp3", "Lan likes music. She also likes drawing.": "audio/cau/a42927a6760bdc56.mp3", "Nam speaks English and also learns Japanese.": "audio/cau/d657bddc45a35d0d.mp3", "I am a student at Kim Dong School.": "audio/cau/7c9effe742362b92.mp3", "I am in Class 6A, and my friends are in 6B.": "audio/cau/69bce6abc68e1822.mp3", "What animal room would you like to create?": "audio/cau/5e05fc71d8b0c067.mp3", "A tiger is a big animal.": "audio/cau/d1413c566bc88fdb.mp3", "My brother loves drawing animals.": "audio/cau/05c49969296ecc10.mp3", "A cat is a small animal, but an elephant is big.": "audio/cau/6225cb8856b5304b.mp3", "Please answer the teacher's question.": "audio/cau/f790ccdd60f40ece.mp3", "Nam asks and Hoa answers.": "audio/cau/128cffcafde831b9.mp3", "Can you tell apart the sounds /b/ and /p/?": "audio/cau/9830d22239b398a2.mp3", "The twins look the same, so I can't tell them apart.": "audio/cau/e371b2b3f4154d90.mp3", "Mi and Nam are in Class 6A.": "audio/cau/b0d165e52ca7dc85.mp3", "We are happy today, and Lan is happy too.": "audio/cau/9718e7702bade08e.mp3", "You can ask your teacher for help.": "audio/cau/675c99f05fae3d5e.mp3", "Phong asked a question, and Mi answered it.": "audio/cau/ad374096f949206b.mp3", "Nam asked his teacher a question.": "audio/cau/4879a0b703b8484f.mp3", "Mi asks a lot of questions; yesterday she asked ten.": "audio/cau/1884bf7fdb16c86c.mp3", "Lan is asking her mother about dinner.": "audio/cau/28eda1c06b5eacae.mp3", "Nam asks a lot, and now he is asking again.": "audio/cau/c563c3f4819710c9.mp3", "Minh asks his friend for a pen.": "audio/cau/463760cf3bb33508.mp3", "Hoa often asks questions, and yesterday she asked ten.": "audio/cau/99ce048ae007844f.mp3", "I attend Le Loi Secondary School.": "audio/cau/2106fb1a21b48167.mp3", "Many people attended the festival.": "audio/cau/d86fc7a983ad38ca.mp3", "Please pay attention to the teacher.": "audio/cau/9cbf379be0e4f13b.mp3", "Lan is an attentive student who pays attention in class.": "audio/cau/991bd7e8b14790af.mp3", "Be attentive in class.": "audio/cau/4c32da426c39662a.mp3", "She is an attentive listener.": "audio/cau/59ab0971a228f869.mp3", "Look at picture b and answer.": "audio/cau/b2672a8a1898ddda.mp3", "Write the letter b next to the right answer.": "audio/cau/9ec7b58bf879e0bc.mp3", "Eating too much sugar is bad for your teeth.": "audio/cau/385b55508b3849c3.mp3", "The traffic was bad today, but yesterday it was worse.": "audio/cau/4db5861a9ee30736.mp3", "Please be quiet in the library.": "audio/cau/d6fab02a2655be4e.mp3", "I want to be a doctor. My sister is a nurse.": "audio/cau/e31166f3ca032296.mp3", "Hoi An is a beautiful old town.": "audio/cau/e98bb193dd75aa2b.mp3", "Lan sings beautifully, and her voice is beautiful.": "audio/cau/4d5c5951771c97b1.mp3", "She sings beautifully.": "audio/cau/d5196d517491e1f4.mp3", "The room is beautifully decorated.": "audio/cau/379b1e778bdefbb9.mp3", "We love the beauty of the countryside.": "audio/cau/b293e5559d039844.mp3", "Ha Long Bay is famous for its beauty; it is really beautiful.": "audio/cau/59dc842a0cb367f8.mp3", "The film was long and boring.": "audio/cau/2fb37c98bad76a4f.mp3", "The lesson was boring, so Nam felt bored.": "audio/cau/0b9b11807d964d8b.mp3", "There is a cat in the box.": "audio/cau/2e85eeb9526b3b0e.mp3", "Put the toys in the box; we have three boxes.": "audio/cau/94612872a7e7c8fc.mp3", "The toys are in the boxes.": "audio/cau/170d9e1f4536be5e.mp3", "Mai puts her books in two boxes.": "audio/cau/895f5119e1e2f239.mp3", "The correct answer is c.": "audio/cau/115cc222c2d7fb6e.mp3", "Look at picture c and describe the girl.": "audio/cau/a211a53ea5c1cc24.mp3", "I call my grandparents every Sunday.": "audio/cau/2d274e78a6c843f7.mp3", "Mi phoned Lan, but Lan didn't answer the call.": "audio/cau/5828a7c8ea6b7c57.mp3", "He started a company called Sun Tech.": "audio/cau/201ec774149f9db7.mp3", "Nam called me last night, and I call him every week.": "audio/cau/4e3a47db5686e0e1.mp3", "Mi can swim very well.": "audio/cau/3e8edac082144330.mp3", "I can ride a bike now, but last year I couldn't.": "audio/cau/af33705bbc26781d.mp3", "My little brother loves cartoons.": "audio/cau/e3de5f142d288cec.mp3", "Doraemon is a famous cartoon.": "audio/cau/4ede853821ac0fa6.mp3", "I watch cartoons on Sunday mornings.": "audio/cau/41a799be9617591a.mp3", "Cartoons make children laugh.": "audio/cau/db5cecd02de5d7a8.mp3", "My favourite channel is VTV3.": "audio/cau/ce1ccf7dc0912f5f.mp3", "Which channel is the cartoon on?": "audio/cau/62c9c1a5f6054a35.mp3", "Tấm is the main character in the story.": "audio/cau/809b3508d2cedfc9.mp3", "She has a kind character.": "audio/cau/33ae03fcd7ecd7ad.mp3", "There are three characters in the story.": "audio/cau/42f47ac3ecb92dd4.mp3", "I like the characters in this cartoon.": "audio/cau/1cc0f45bc548a362.mp3", "I often chat with my neighbours.": "audio/cau/f9bdc10e4250f241.mp3", "Mi and Lan had a long chat after school.": "audio/cau/92771962baaa6db3.mp3", "Check your answers with a partner.": "audio/cau/8656910f569b2925.mp3", "Mi checked her work, and the check took ten minutes.": "audio/cau/53e04ae5ad0ce9eb.mp3", "Every child in the village goes to school.": "audio/cau/9f966cc92f3b2d70.mp3", "When he was a child, he lived with his grandparents.": "audio/cau/5f1982ddb057760f.mp3", "I had a happy childhood in the countryside.": "audio/cau/29493d8d0469345f.mp3", "This song reminds me of my childhood.": "audio/cau/a5f0b56f6286f10d.mp3", "She has three children and two grandchildren.": "audio/cau/41e17d5597e264f0.mp3", "One child was quiet, but the other children were noisy.": "audio/cau/863bff50c6e9f303.mp3", "You have a choice of tea or juice.": "audio/cau/d83c640d99d55e18.mp3", "I think you made a good choice.": "audio/cau/89c0a3eddbcb6efd.mp3", "Minh is a clever boy.": "audio/cau/620f8c5f3017a282.mp3", "Lan is clever. She answers the questions cleverly.": "audio/cau/2720a9ae3428f690.mp3", "She answered the question cleverly.": "audio/cau/b127f7ca5556eeca.mp3", "The robot is cleverly designed.": "audio/cau/78c94fc4362f7380.mp3", "Everyone praised his cleverness.": "audio/cau/8a333324f6d5417b.mp3", "The fox is known for its cleverness.": "audio/cau/165b55f081837120.mp3", "Complete the sentences with the words.": "audio/cau/a10abe8427f587a5.mp3", "Mi completed her homework. Now it is complete.": "audio/cau/e89d49e3a54806e8.mp3", "Lan completely forgot her friend's birthday.": "audio/cau/ae968fd2ecb01b87.mp3", "Minh completely forgot about his homework.": "audio/cau/4ec9cda7a9209eb1.mp3", "Listen to the conversation and answer.": "audio/cau/9f48e7934c974946.mp3", "Mi had a short chat, not a long conversation.": "audio/cau/e32ab06f1cea65e6.mp3", "We converse in English in class.": "audio/cau/53bd8ab15aee8ea4.mp3", "They conversed for hours.": "audio/cau/0ca95dc23e5e741b.mp3", "Choose the correct answer A, B or C.": "audio/cau/6f45c31e9ee537be.mp3", "Nam's answer is correct, but mine is wrong.": "audio/cau/2f88ef38a2385ee5.mp3", "The teacher made corrections in red.": "audio/cau/895634813fdf81d2.mp3", "Check your corrections carefully.": "audio/cau/c829f7ab4f978d5b.mp3", "Try to say these new words correctly.": "audio/cau/d4da04af4337ec0f.mp3", "Her answer is correct because she read the question correctly.": "audio/cau/cee1de65a2a9d88f.mp3", "Viet Nam is a beautiful country.": "audio/cau/df0215608f1e8de4.mp3", "My grandparents live in the countryside of our country.": "audio/cau/00375e3b63fb00b1.mp3", "Life in the countryside is peaceful.": "audio/cau/95479ebba178019f.mp3", "The city is noisy, but the countryside is quiet.": "audio/cau/37f198fe8e1a722b.mp3", "Lan creates a to-do list every Sunday evening.": "audio/cau/87a26e3235a8f368.mp3", "Our class created a poster about healthy living.": "audio/cau/97dc8c8a67b315e5.mp3", "My little dog is very cute.": "audio/cau/40fd772b6ba6dec2.mp3", "Mi's baby sister is cute and lovely.": "audio/cau/06e5af2adbf27342.mp3", "Everyone loves the puppy's cuteness.": "audio/cau/8f9225069818a663.mp3", "The baby's cuteness made us smile.": "audio/cau/b38bbcc002f11870.mp3", "Look at picture d and answer the question.": "audio/cau/cd1db823a64876e3.mp3", "Choose answer d, then write it in your notebook.": "audio/cau/d8924058670ef40e.mp3", "The death of his dog made him sad.": "audio/cau/16557e1350bb02d1.mp3", "Smoking can cause death.": "audio/cau/e5da19be59040040.mp3", "I did my homework last night.": "audio/cau/52c1dc6ad84a16a5.mp3", "Did you do the project? Yes, I did.": "audio/cau/ce2a17ba3a5d2ade.mp3", "Customs differ from country to country.": "audio/cau/867f1b35e7b382a9.mp3", "The twins differ in character.": "audio/cau/6fe7387847575daa.mp3", "What is the difference between these pictures?": "audio/cau/6c98c14e1c41bd67.mp3", "Small actions can make a big difference.": "audio/cau/2df232067e45e4a5.mp3", "My house is different from yours.": "audio/cau/5abda8894fc87510.mp3", "Lan and Mi are different; the difference is their hobbies.": "audio/cau/fd7e006914631783.mp3", "People think differently.": "audio/cau/f177b3ef34202d8f.mp3", "The word is spelled differently in American English.": "audio/cau/f1593ad480f9bd47.mp3", "I disagree with your idea.": "audio/cau/7cce19c50dd76b38.mp3", "Nam agrees, but Lan disagrees with him.": "audio/cau/c54e8ccfbafa7323.mp3", "They had a disagreement about the trip.": "audio/cau/f1d5a16d4f41e479.mp3", "We sometimes disagree, but each disagreement is small.": "audio/cau/9bbbf8d89f966fd1.mp3", "It was an important discovery.": "audio/cau/23f9b4c1af7c300b.mp3", "The discovery of fire changed human life.": "audio/cau/d273e705a86eca5f.mp3", "Let's discuss the problem in groups.": "audio/cau/cef13322a0d3b68b.mp3", "We discuss the plan, and the discussion takes ten minutes.": "audio/cau/a31966bdeac63e89.mp3", "We had a discussion about city life.": "audio/cau/d84c065603f75017.mp3", "After the discussion, we discussed it again with our teacher.": "audio/cau/054b4021e8aa37b4.mp3", "I dislike noisy and crowded places.": "audio/cau/5ace2bb2616bf75c.mp3", "Mi likes cats, but she dislikes dogs.": "audio/cau/a21ccd81f7c8d400.mp3", "I do my homework after dinner.": "audio/cau/dfa2558950305f83.mp3", "Phong did his homework, and now it is done.": "audio/cau/4e496982963ec9df.mp3", "Does Lan like ice cream?": "audio/cau/15298c934c7dedf6.mp3", "Nam does his homework, but he doesn't watch TV.": "audio/cau/16100881d98fba74.mp3", "I have done my homework.": "audio/cau/319d28fa8d112271.mp3", "Nam did the test well; he has done a great job.": "audio/cau/a6f61635ce93b0e4.mp3", "My sister earns money by teaching English.": "audio/cau/c708ac6757535a40.mp3", "Farmers earn money from selling rice.": "audio/cau/03d9921e17db3edc.mp3", "Parents educate their children at home.": "audio/cau/1bf61214a6394971.mp3", "We need to educate people about recycling.": "audio/cau/87c8839b3ccd5e36.mp3", "Education is important for everyone.": "audio/cau/5d6f4743dd6ecbfa.mp3", "This educational game is good for children's education.": "audio/cau/f45236ae6a0aab5e.mp3", "This TV programme is very educational.": "audio/cau/64bdf062aa2bbb82.mp3", "We play educational games in class.": "audio/cau/78139978b5e7ee80.mp3", "The soldiers fought the enemy bravely.": "audio/cau/d7e74b5bf24e5f1e.mp3", "The cat is the enemy of the mouse.": "audio/cau/9cbb92de9d0d7660.mp3", "I enjoy living in the city.": "audio/cau/1cc10e53aebeec12.mp3", "We enjoy the trip because it is very enjoyable.": "audio/cau/1a682a8a24ff63b3.mp3", "We had an enjoyable trip to Da Lat.": "audio/cau/fa0dde7e848371c0.mp3", "The English lesson was enjoyable.": "audio/cau/339769385e39a593.mp3", "Reading gives me a lot of enjoyment.": "audio/cau/baba1a4ac12d7cb6.mp3", "He plays the guitar for enjoyment.": "audio/cau/1ffb1fdae1d623a4.mp3", "Write T for true or F for false.": "audio/cau/d086c486993b428b.mp3", "Sentence 2 is false, so Nam writes F.": "audio/cau/87a27d221b2ce0ec.mp3", "It's a fact that the Earth is round.": "audio/cau/b121d7ad72995c5d.mp3", "Here are some fun facts about pandas.": "audio/cau/459ea7bf4553f911.mp3", "Read the text and find the facts.": "audio/cau/f78e3160ca3359a6.mp3", "In fact, Minh is older than his friend Nam.": "audio/cau/442cfdb55329f3e4.mp3", "Hoi An is famous for its lanterns.": "audio/cau/be0831db3c3bf621.mp3", "General Giap became famous, and his fame spread worldwide.": "audio/cau/4eabd5e77fd10a06.mp3", "We had a fantastic holiday.": "audio/cau/f32cf4ee7488001e.mp3", "The view from the top is fantastic.": "audio/cau/e447250983ededde.mp3", "Eat less fatty food to stay healthy.": "audio/cau/3c633ae3a4db1581.mp3", "Fast food is often fatty.": "audio/cau/8ab7a9d77d67d1ec.mp3", "My favourite room is the kitchen.": "audio/cau/7fe9b9a43268f379.mp3", "Football is Nam's favourite sport.": "audio/cau/5418f30ef37044b0.mp3", "I finish my homework before dinner.": "audio/cau/4c12023029931700.mp3", "Hoa started the project in May and finished it in June.": "audio/cau/92423d5fe3d5c777.mp3", "Focus on the main events in his life.": "audio/cau/568e05bcb3ccde4d.mp3", "It's noisy, so Mi can't concentrate or focus on homework.": "audio/cau/e984cbce9e79c312.mp3", "Phong plays football with his friends.": "audio/cau/9baf509a6408f617.mp3", "Nam likes football and watches it every weekend.": "audio/cau/617a4e3bf9b2e89d.mp3", "The fox is a clever animal.": "audio/cau/c4826d15d3962b24.mp3", "A fox stole a chicken last night.": "audio/cau/731b64a0ee017147.mp3", "Lan is my good friend.": "audio/cau/dd872f787d0777d3.mp3", "My friend Minh is very friendly.": "audio/cau/4f7040d4f93a465f.mp3", "Tourists love the friendliness of local people.": "audio/cau/a40be7352a7002db.mp3", "Her friendliness makes everyone happy.": "audio/cau/a90e79e9d7f1fffe.mp3", "Our new teacher is very friendly.": "audio/cau/0062f01a22f8a341.mp3", "Nam is friendly and has many friends.": "audio/cau/1865a7313d83db0c.mp3", "Our friendship is very important to me.": "audio/cau/01f0404c79a2081f.mp3", "Lan and Hoa are close friends; their friendship is strong.": "audio/cau/9389591d845cf52e.mp3", "We have fun at the summer camp.": "audio/cau/042795d03f276893.mp3", "The game was fun, and Nam's jokes were funny.": "audio/cau/1343a6a406625409.mp3", "My uncle is very funny.": "audio/cau/3365f3c2b0a43869.mp3", "Phong is funny, so playing with him is fun.": "audio/cau/754492bd17fda5cf.mp3", "The word 'garden' starts with the letter G.": "audio/cau/855344adad6266b6.mp3", "Please write a capital G on the board.": "audio/cau/090b2d929a80461a.mp3", "We play a game in our English class.": "audio/cau/f89d92956bddd8c5.mp3", "My brother is a gamer, and he loves this game.": "audio/cau/5869b678fdd00fcc.mp3", "My brother is a serious gamer.": "audio/cau/7a29eee205c35813.mp3", "Gamers should take breaks to rest their eyes.": "audio/cau/714192b94227026f.mp3", "I go to school by bike.": "audio/cau/df5dcef1ab40916f.mp3", "We often go to the beach; last summer we went to Nha Trang.": "audio/cau/9dac5f396b6a209e.mp3", "Mum has gone to the market.": "audio/cau/85901dafd6c6e677.mp3", "The rain has gone.": "audio/cau/42856535a7f42416.mp3", "Nam is good at maths.": "audio/cau/4fd3587c745c05a2.mp3", "Lan's English is good, but Mi's is better.": "audio/cau/d371c25a8502dc92.mp3", "My goodness! It's so hot today.": "audio/cau/262b2c15cb0e80ce.mp3", "She helped us out of goodness.": "audio/cau/68406886afe46623.mp3", "That's a great idea for our project!": "audio/cau/a54aafc7aa505f92.mp3", "We had a great time; the trip was wonderful.": "audio/cau/3dc3e9c44a5960ce.mp3", "Your help is greatly appreciated.": "audio/cau/3e7c4dbae7d688f3.mp3", "Technology has greatly changed our lives.": "audio/cau/718fe374663a2930.mp3", "Each group has four members.": "audio/cau/6db9bb96270db26c.mp3", "Work in groups and report your group's findings.": "audio/cau/dd390edb36c261a2.mp3", "The teacher puts us into groups of five.": "audio/cau/ec8808da410c34e5.mp3", "Our class has six groups, and each group has six students.": "audio/cau/0f693c5a4478ab4f.mp3", "We had a great time at the camp.": "audio/cau/9119cf6bce83ae88.mp3", "I have breakfast at six, but yesterday I had it late.": "audio/cau/8a0bd1bf7d672961.mp3", "The maths test was very hard.": "audio/cau/0fd61471858155e3.mp3", "Minh works hard; he is a hardworking student.": "audio/cau/32c549e4a9f6fc13.mp3", "Lan has two brothers.": "audio/cau/3ee04272e80b66c1.mp3", "Nam has a new bike; he had an old one before.": "audio/cau/756f69898700b7f4.mp3", "I hate waiting for the bus in the rain.": "audio/cau/3f99a8ce5b4ab56c.mp3", "Nam likes city life, but he hates traffic jams.": "audio/cau/6300158d6a0d3117.mp3", "I have a cat and a dog.": "audio/cau/3942c510ddf250d4.mp3", "We have English today, and we had Maths yesterday.": "audio/cau/f53b658e1d0dc09e.mp3", "We are having lunch in the canteen.": "audio/cau/68be2432f9d1c150.mp3", "Lan is having fun because she has many friends here.": "audio/cau/955a8fc5bad8bd17.mp3", "My bedroom is here, next to the kitchen.": "audio/cau/38f5476965ee13ae.mp3", "Come here, Nam! Your bag is over there.": "audio/cau/1518838d605d3769.mp3", "Let's play hide-and-seek!": "audio/cau/92bdf95ba8e2006c.mp3", "Where did you hide the key?": "audio/cau/353d0b3791179764.mp3", "Highlight the new words in yellow.": "audio/cau/d498bca60b2480af.mp3", "The highlight of the trip was the cave.": "audio/cau/70cc00f7daf64e62.mp3", "Match each highlighted word with its definition.": "audio/cau/2054b6647f7ccadc.mp3", "Lan highlighted the new words with a yellow highlighter.": "audio/cau/ecd4a9023406bc13.mp3", "I use a pink highlighter for key words.": "audio/cau/a9c241d4fed9b266.mp3", "Can I borrow your highlighter?": "audio/cau/dc25525dc68ae2af.mp3", "My teacher is very humorous.": "audio/cau/8f6ba9ed4e3a796d.mp3", "I read a humorous story yesterday.": "audio/cau/d81d0caf2c1c6edb.mp3", "Your homework is incomplete.": "audio/cau/1def1df8007e7413.mp3", "Complete the incomplete sentences.": "audio/cau/865265a2ff56d7b1.mp3", "Correct the incorrect sentences.": "audio/cau/0fa204f88cc856c0.mp3", "Your answer is incorrect, so please correct it.": "audio/cau/2d6a22f249708653.mp3", "Dolphins are intelligent animals.": "audio/cau/ff347eccc7ca9ffd.mp3", "She is an intelligent student.": "audio/cau/3510c8cda7bcca9d.mp3", "English is an international language.": "audio/cau/40571347e9372f5c.mp3", "Noi Bai is an international airport.": "audio/cau/30892f46c587c1e3.mp3", "My school is big and beautiful.": "audio/cau/d5765e25cafa0eea.mp3", "Today it is sunny, but yesterday it was rainy.": "audio/cau/ed1bcaf6501bfd0c.mp3", "It's a perfect present for kids aged between 10 and 15.": "audio/cau/0a1ccb836dfdb1d4.mp3", "The kids play in the park; children love it.": "audio/cau/30844ad30dbeea3e.mp3", "Uncle Ho is known and loved by all Vietnamese people.": "audio/cau/e714527fbec233eb.mp3", "Many people know him; he is well known in Viet Nam.": "audio/cau/ea446edd847c7b43.mp3", "The word 'lamp' starts with the letter l.": "audio/cau/c5e08a5413a4f66b.mp3", "Please write a capital L on the board.": "audio/cau/63173cda63a08912.mp3", "We learn English at school.": "audio/cau/9bc26f3d76057248.mp3", "Nam wants to learn to swim, and his sister learnt last year.": "audio/cau/5a7392296080d626.mp3", "She is a fast learner.": "audio/cau/bdda689dc68ad8a3.mp3", "This book is for English learners.": "audio/cau/5aa493db6a382d2e.mp3", "They are learning English now.": "audio/cau/dd1a1d45e6dbee72.mp3", "Mi is learning to swim; she learnt a lot last week.": "audio/cau/f28b08757f5f0cdc.mp3", "I learnt a new song today.": "audio/cau/002dc8ba978f437b.mp3", "Mi likes to learn new words; yesterday she learnt ten.": "audio/cau/01afc6c13b541caf.mp3", "Describe your hair by its length and colour.": "audio/cau/ad23f44edd907020.mp3", "The length of the table is two metres; it's long.": "audio/cau/84f01bf78c674bd1.mp3", "Let me help you with your bags.": "audio/cau/41dd52ad0f012862.mp3", "Mum let me go out yesterday; she lets me go on Sundays.": "audio/cau/46fc2d4c33221e5d.mp3", "Let's go to the craft village!": "audio/cau/2c8a106859ac7f9e.mp3", "Let's make lanterns; let us start now.": "audio/cau/d804af85f9b3cff1.mp3", "He had a difficult life when he was young.": "audio/cau/0e2c7b87c896e8b7.mp3", "City life is busy, and people live very fast.": "audio/cau/c7a56b97906b19d2.mp3", "I like noodles very much.": "audio/cau/7557928354c11c4a.mp3", "I like cats, but I dislike spiders.": "audio/cau/bdd9c25c87fbc823.mp3", "Minh likes playing football.": "audio/cau/8b21f729dbeb8632.mp3", "Hoa likes music, but I like art.": "audio/cau/e9144dc6f8053afb.mp3", "Please listen to Lan's life story carefully.": "audio/cau/5e66ffcca03d62ba.mp3", "Minh is a good listener; he always listens to his friends.": "audio/cau/2a4b1d64993cd32a.mp3", "My mum is a good listener.": "audio/cau/c361fe2d103db23c.mp3", "The radio programme has many listeners.": "audio/cau/95723f87c574336f.mp3", "Thank you for listening.": "audio/cau/ee26d140bc752b99.mp3", "Nam is listening to music; he loves to listen to pop songs.": "audio/cau/8451afe66a0bd788.mp3", "My little brother is five years old.": "audio/cau/e22af4e6bb3d77f0.mp3", "I have a little money, but my sister has less.": "audio/cau/520fdc680c743ed9.mp3", "We live in a small village.": "audio/cau/8438d091662da029.mp3", "My grandparents live in the countryside and have a happy life.": "audio/cau/a21ec63c6b42bc8d.mp3", "Ho Chi Minh City is very lively at night.": "audio/cau/f7f9de50246fc30a.mp3", "The market is lively and busy in the morning.": "audio/cau/be87297ba2d5a7fc.mp3", "There is a big sofa in the living room.": "audio/cau/85ee341c5ccef3a3.mp3", "We live in a small house with a nice living room.": "audio/cau/a4537e161135cc8a.mp3", "The Mekong is a very long river.": "audio/cau/962b2d2abaecb121.mp3", "Mi has long hair, but Lan has short hair.": "audio/cau/21e34cbfd1358b0e.mp3", "Mai has a lot of friends at school.": "audio/cau/5010f52a3a68ba0b.mp3", "Minh reads a lot, and he has lots of books.": "audio/cau/356256a0d64c06ca.mp3", "There are lots of books in our school library.": "audio/cau/3190c7d803a13870.mp3", "Phong has lots of friends and a lot of free time.": "audio/cau/4a66fae37e042e36.mp3", "I love my family.": "audio/cau/02c5061798cc56cc.mp3", "My grandma is loving, and I love her a lot.": "audio/cau/588e4f5967e2076b.mp3", "What a lovely day!": "audio/cau/d4038241635895d6.mp3", "Her little sister is lovely.": "audio/cau/2566ff2d6fc065b2.mp3", "My mother is a loving person.": "audio/cau/5a0aadfbccb5dec1.mp3", "Hoa has a loving family, and she loves them a lot.": "audio/cau/dbfb0082905aad2d.mp3", "I'm a student at Nguyen Du High School.": "audio/cau/fc4e40becc452649.mp3", "I'm happy because I am with my best friends.": "audio/cau/70dc61c954d001ef.mp3", "He made his first computer in a small garage.": "audio/cau/ab57132318aeca10.mp3", "This vase is made of clay; people make it in Bat Trang.": "audio/cau/e23523961a9ed154.mp3", "The main problem in the city is traffic.": "audio/cau/5de5106d00321b17.mp3", "The main roads are busy, mainly in the morning.": "audio/cau/8298c8b4a3e2e8a4.mp3", "People here mainly grow rice.": "audio/cau/39ba45d7f9277780.mp3", "I mainly use my phone for study.": "audio/cau/7e14d886ebe6707d.mp3", "Traffic is a major problem in big cities.": "audio/cau/0f5358c82438a060.mp3", "Rice is a major crop in Viet Nam.": "audio/cau/322561f4bfe9c225.mp3", "Hard work can make your dreams come true.": "audio/cau/b31d6220b696ab85.mp3", "He made many mistakes, but he learnt to make good choices.": "audio/cau/f95abe45aba09ae8.mp3", "He is a famous film maker.": "audio/cau/68e4b5c408bfa483.mp3", "My uncle is a furniture maker.": "audio/cau/177cfe96f7f1bf13.mp3", "My mother makes spring rolls at Tet.": "audio/cau/c6bb3a72ed840478.mp3", "Mi makes a cake today; yesterday she made cookies.": "audio/cau/eaa71b7044b2e690.mp3", "Hoa uses red to mark exam days on her calendar.": "audio/cau/78135abe90fe0ad6.mp3", "Nam marks his due dates with a yellow pen.": "audio/cau/9321f43accfdd88b.mp3", "We have our exams in May.": "audio/cau/596706c87a49f74e.mp3", "May is a hot month in the south.": "audio/cau/a0fc44757a99e818.mp3", "It's only a minor problem.": "audio/cau/84eacb68a176f893.mp3", "He had a minor accident.": "audio/cau/f51fe0ff705346ef.mp3", "I listen to music every evening.": "audio/cau/947b04b66aabe669.mp3", "Phong loves music, and he wants to be a musician.": "audio/cau/2a338296f019ee09.mp3", "Can you play a musical instrument?": "audio/cau/4b45a019b7f1df1c.mp3", "She comes from a musical family.": "audio/cau/da92e12306feca96.mp3", "Trinh Cong Son is a famous musician.": "audio/cau/44ebea42904bff46.mp3", "She wants to be a musician.": "audio/cau/a69499a50cc7cc48.mp3", "In 'running', we double the letter n.": "audio/cau/f2d3227ba2e63feb.mp3", "Run ends in n, so we write running with two n's.": "audio/cau/840a0ecac7ac2b05.mp3", "Viet Nam is a nation of 54 ethnic groups.": "audio/cau/fc0377b6b344369a.mp3", "The whole nation celebrates Tet.": "audio/cau/bde6381a94c2d89f.mp3", "He started a new life in Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/c5e37434302d9841.mp3", "This bike is new, but that one is old.": "audio/cau/dae26bf3d19dc70a.mp3", "We live in a newly built house.": "audio/cau/966f2a75601347b9.mp3", "The park was newly opened.": "audio/cau/3a8e3879e38476c9.mp3", "I watch the news on TV every evening.": "audio/cau/4eec6079f4f4c6a3.mp3", "The news is good: a new park is open.": "audio/cau/c4024e28c9bf5003.mp3", "Nice to meet you, Mai.": "audio/cau/7c4c4da145e9a59d.mp3", "Lan is nice, and she always speaks nicely.": "audio/cau/b93deacf2eeac62d.mp3", "She did not give up her dream.": "audio/cau/b5d39e3052bc5fbb.mp3", "I am not tired, and I'm not hungry.": "audio/cau/9485504d93b05a38.mp3", "Did you notice her new haircut?": "audio/cau/f0ec69a680ab4edb.mp3", "Read the notice on the board.": "audio/cau/decda91337e8460e.mp3", "I am doing my homework now.": "audio/cau/c512289bbb165978.mp3", "It is raining now, so we stay at home.": "audio/cau/ac1b5a1cae28deb6.mp3", "Turn off the lights when you leave.": "audio/cau/3a68f3ab6e248006.mp3", "Turn on the fan, but turn off the TV.": "audio/cau/bdd957c99adde5f0.mp3", "My grandfather is seventy years old.": "audio/cau/ad4ec0973ce447a3.mp3", "My bike is old, but my sister's bike is new.": "audio/cau/dc292ece9d402a3f.mp3", "In my opinion, English is very interesting.": "audio/cau/8ea4c0f89c483967.mp3", "Lan has a different idea, but I respect her opinion.": "audio/cau/aab5c99fa33e70ce.mp3", "Mi went out with her friends last night.": "audio/cau/6662db3eac9ce4e0.mp3", "Nam wants to find out more about his grandfather's life.": "audio/cau/c2c4b3120ecb6468.mp3", "The film starts at 8 p.m.": "audio/cau/5b3d11f7cb5bec98.mp3", "School finishes at 4.30 p.m., and I have dinner at 7 p.m.": "audio/cau/6193e0ae396e4d78.mp3", "My dad paid for the tickets.": "audio/cau/b4014cbad8c7d1da.mp3", "I paid 20,000 dong for the book.": "audio/cau/5359db2d26ba3bf6.mp3", "I need a new pair of shoes for school.": "audio/cau/250c1c4ccfb0d448.mp3", "Find a partner and work in pairs.": "audio/cau/9f9cc8d6f86e7886.mp3", "Work in pairs and ask each other questions.": "audio/cau/2bae203d74ef1339.mp3", "There are ten pairs, so each pair gets one card.": "audio/cau/6a0e4948c63a816b.mp3", "Every parent loves their children.": "audio/cau/f0f02e141cda079d.mp3", "My mum is a kind parent.": "audio/cau/fc0100e2293df4cc.mp3", "This app has parental controls.": "audio/cau/8a73f889c7960108.mp3", "Children need parental love.": "audio/cau/74f6bcb6352c58be.mp3", "My parents are always kind and patient.": "audio/cau/f70296736693e0b8.mp3", "My dad is a busy parent, but my parents always eat dinner with us.": "audio/cau/02cfa7df92c1de83.mp3", "Ask your partner about his favourite food.": "audio/cau/422fdd4d69934397.mp3", "Minh is my partner, and we work in pairs.": "audio/cau/c79cf650c67747ae.mp3", "How much do you pay for a bowl of pho?": "audio/cau/e807ddb92a3f24db.mp3", "Mum paid for the books yesterday.": "audio/cau/15922b0414be0bc7.mp3", "You can make a payment by phone.": "audio/cau/364d4d9ceff8c0e1.mp3", "Cash payment is still popular.": "audio/cau/3becbcc878ec652a.mp3", "There are five people in my family.": "audio/cau/61d24a117613907d.mp3", "One person is late, but the other people are here.": "audio/cau/b4e5b7ba18b09096.mp3", "He is a kind and hard-working person.": "audio/cau/a7cc8ccdfee48d42.mp3", "One person came first, then many people came.": "audio/cau/e2f7a3bc001f7fc0.mp3", "This is a nice place to live.": "audio/cau/160e9180eaed0aee.mp3", "Let's meet at the usual place after school.": "audio/cau/f760c0b8e65d51b8.mp3", "There are many interesting places in my town.": "audio/cau/22530fda716b27a9.mp3", "The market is my favourite place in town.": "audio/cau/6904ef4273568097.mp3", "This singer is popular with teenagers.": "audio/cau/fdbd5fd7ebddf922.mp3", "Football is the most popular sport in Viet Nam.": "audio/cau/a567791eb72955db.mp3", "The game's popularity is growing.": "audio/cau/126119d057896ab4.mp3", "K-pop has great popularity in Vietnam.": "audio/cau/edcc5616984001a4.mp3", "I prefer city life to country life.": "audio/cau/0916a5f25eb75bbe.mp3", "Mi prefers tea, but I would rather have juice.": "audio/cau/75544e3025e8e8e7.mp3", "Walking is preferable to driving here.": "audio/cau/7128c885715d78ae.mp3", "A quiet room is preferable for studying.": "audio/cau/c09be5637ada9f86.mp3", "My preference is tea, not coffee.": "audio/cau/19a064222852a059.mp3", "Do you have a preference?": "audio/cau/6b66357c48b57574.mp3", "She preferred the blue dress.": "audio/cau/43c009ab1379cac1.mp3", "I preferred staying at home.": "audio/cau/30c7ef4f6c4f0761.mp3", "Each group will present their project to the class.": "audio/cau/6116c3864aebd817.mp3", "Hoa presented her project about her grandfather.": "audio/cau/199806383df2605a.mp3", "She has a pretty face.": "audio/cau/b4057ea8bc4143dd.mp3", "The test was pretty easy.": "audio/cau/c3222808c2b9263e.mp3", "My favourite TV programme is on at 8.": "audio/cau/36028f8073ccd137.mp3", "The school has an exchange programme.": "audio/cau/da61eabb35538c0b.mp3", "I like cartoon programmes.": "audio/cau/2c3014a89f316339.mp3", "There are many good programmes for kids.": "audio/cau/57404dbb7bf31570.mp3", "The word 'red' starts with the letter r.": "audio/cau/19d12f34975f740f.mp3", "'Rabbit' and 'room' both begin with R.": "audio/cau/aca28cd4f322eeb4.mp3", "I read a book before bed every night.": "audio/cau/52f4120305948c56.mp3", "Yesterday Mi read a story, because reading is her hobby.": "audio/cau/a206c7fecbd29a47.mp3", "My sister is a fast reader.": "audio/cau/c997b3414e90f2e3.mp3", "Lan is a good reader because she reads every day.": "audio/cau/804882ef0e352a60.mp3", "Reading helps us learn new words.": "audio/cau/a36b0142402545f6.mp3", "I read a story last night, and it was great.": "audio/cau/67941e0da7d7be3c.mp3", "Is this a real flower?": "audio/cau/c4352f757425274a.mp3", "He is my real friend.": "audio/cau/9c27c75ea3fb5cf0.mp3", "Your answer is right, Nam.": "audio/cau/de0207c9ebd60141.mp3", "Is this answer right or wrong?": "audio/cau/6f5632fc348cdcbc.mp3", "She's my best friend in class 6A.": "audio/cau/810592fcf73e04e7.mp3", "This is Vinh's bike, and he's in my class.": "audio/cau/6a8b8131a5222edf.mp3", "Mi and I are in the same class.": "audio/cau/bc1a18955ee28275.mp3", "My bag is the same as yours, not different.": "audio/cau/b8e990694854227f.mp3", "I saw a beautiful rainbow yesterday afternoon.": "audio/cau/87d8e8a9aa1c8cb1.mp3", "We saw many animals at the zoo.": "audio/cau/bf15ca1e43e22b9a.mp3", "What do you say when you meet someone?": "audio/cau/ebd766cb7a0b37c7.mp3", "Say hello! Mi said hello to everyone.": "audio/cau/835b6b164eec79c4.mp3", "Can you see the picture on page ten?": "audio/cau/505d4b7b963a3756.mp3", "I saw Lan yesterday, and I'll see her tomorrow.": "audio/cau/d14cce6b0cd0e6db.mp3", "Have you seen the new market in town?": "audio/cau/0689eb245aec2ebc.mp3", "Yes, I have seen it; I saw it last week.": "audio/cau/476814d0d69a0131.mp3", "Air pollution is a serious problem.": "audio/cau/451a7484a9226374.mp3", "Our teacher looks serious today.": "audio/cau/128bbd7598114bcd.mp3", "My brother is short, but he plays basketball well.": "audio/cau/d8ddf117afef7434.mp3", "Minh is tall, but his brother is short.": "audio/cau/fa281035bc257ead.mp3", "Show your photos to the class.": "audio/cau/2238dc578e393ea6.mp3", "Nam showed us photos of his village.": "audio/cau/212c93e8427b7095.mp3", "The artisan showed us how to make lanterns.": "audio/cau/897188b380de15ca.mp3", "Please show me too; you showed Mi yesterday.": "audio/cau/f493ef15d21acfbb.mp3", "The film is shown on TV tonight.": "audio/cau/75e35008646b299e.mp3", "She has shown me her new room.": "audio/cau/d93aaba1ebaa7897.mp3", "The timeline shows the important events in his life.": "audio/cau/842231fd94ad1d43.mp3", "This photo shows my grandfather as a young man.": "audio/cau/f9a1966a7b553101.mp3", "My grandpa has poor sight.": "audio/cau/5906c0adbcad9b65.mp3", "The sunset over the sea is a beautiful sight.": "audio/cau/39836f836f67a5ef.mp3", "Life in my city is similar to life in yours.": "audio/cau/b89b4fb5bd2e62ee.mp3", "Hoa and Lan look similar, but their hobbies are different.": "audio/cau/612906abb392c0a7.mp3", "There is a similarity between the two stories.": "audio/cau/5e7f0978e1ff716e.mp3", "I see a similarity between you and your mum.": "audio/cau/6cf9435c1f3a000c.mp3", "The two sisters dress similarly.": "audio/cau/5e58452bd7fa9e2e.mp3", "Similarly, we should save electricity at school.": "audio/cau/124a6e7eba967203.mp3", "We sing English songs in class.": "audio/cau/026846f6b8826235.mp3", "Mi sang a song; she is a good singer.": "audio/cau/880ccad023e24637.mp3", "My sister wants to be a singer.": "audio/cau/8a321cf9c02f1183.mp3", "Who is your favourite singer?": "audio/cau/61920cc689201a93.mp3", "Ha Noi is planning to become a smart city.": "audio/cau/534a2d2742fd455c.mp3", "My smart cousin made an app for smartphones.": "audio/cau/a451335c10c8aa7f.mp3", "I'm so pleased you won the prize!": "audio/cau/345d567c5208a7af.mp3", "It was raining, so we stayed at home.": "audio/cau/d3e8c1c4c40bf63a.mp3", "This is my favourite song.": "audio/cau/541e14c148c17e10.mp3", "Let's sing a song together!": "audio/cau/2582c08c2be3a294.mp3", "Minh is very sporty; he plays sport every day.": "audio/cau/8f3a07ca267912a7.mp3", "My favourite sports are football and swimming.": "audio/cau/8a24f3303ec53899.mp3", "Badminton is a popular sport, and Nam loves all sports.": "audio/cau/76b12d75a3439875.mp3", "My sister is sporty and plays volleyball.": "audio/cau/e6b11ca23dbab79b.mp3", "Phong is sporty, so his favourite sport is football.": "audio/cau/4d26845d5c555def.mp3", "My grandma is a great storyteller.": "audio/cau/5e7c88fb2310eebf.mp3", "The storyteller made the children laugh.": "audio/cau/3b52a1dad829ac46.mp3", "I study English every evening.": "audio/cau/2a98035816ae0fe1.mp3", "Hoa is a studious student; she likes to study maths.": "audio/cau/81fcae64bc4c3e71.mp3", "Lan is studying for her English test now.": "audio/cau/cb697036271d7db2.mp3", "The students are studying in the library.": "audio/cau/3e449c654c7e4156.mp3", "This mango is very sweet.": "audio/cau/a1e5323b108609f7.mp3", "What a sweet little girl!": "audio/cau/629dd9e3583638d0.mp3", "In \"don't\", the letter t comes from not.": "audio/cau/549e7bc5a2456c75.mp3", "I didn't go out because I was tired.": "audio/cau/5cc7479c1b749e64.mp3", "Put your books on the table, please.": "audio/cau/467dab8d487aa55a.mp3", "Our timetable is a table of all our lessons.": "audio/cau/995dc4d40f2b5ff8.mp3", "I often talk to my grandma on the phone.": "audio/cau/30262ea1745db608.mp3", "Lan is talkative; she loves to talk and chat with friends.": "audio/cau/ef14453a567466fc.mp3", "There is a television in the living room.": "audio/cau/b6e9f08b84a3491c.mp3", "My grandma watches television in the evening.": "audio/cau/405c173d0715402b.mp3", "Please tell me about your hometown.": "audio/cau/d5098eae824e03fa.mp3", "My grandpa told me a story last night.": "audio/cau/ba19b792ce3534dc.mp3", "The traffic in the city is terrible today.": "audio/cau/01ea841928344884.mp3", "The food was terrible, but the view was wonderful.": "audio/cau/93b659e2b5f66a2e.mp3", "There is a big garden in my house.": "audio/cau/94db3c106fafa1ac.mp3", "Your bag is here, and my bag is over there.": "audio/cau/37204e4c7e951d02.mp3", "We have English on Thursday.": "audio/cau/17a14cb2db198d8f.mp3", "See you next Thursday!": "audio/cau/7ac83f64691015d8.mp3", "I play badminton on Thursdays.": "audio/cau/966f0cce8ab56128.mp3", "The library closes early on Thursdays.": "audio/cau/c04ab16c904c2529.mp3", "Tick the correct answers.": "audio/cau/03211fde6b6a3087.mp3", "Put a tick next to the things you did.": "audio/cau/579b575a47a252d1.mp3", "Let's look at our new timetable.": "audio/cau/b37160eda36c9395.mp3", "We have Maths on Monday according to the timetable.": "audio/cau/46e65b162f79e5db.mp3", "Today is Monday, and I have maths.": "audio/cau/a2c1db38d6bad1f7.mp3", "It is sunny today, so we play outside.": "audio/cau/43f448f8abe01280.mp3", "We worked together on the project.": "audio/cau/69b6290ba4ffa803.mp3", "They live together, but Minh lives alone.": "audio/cau/48beeee1f86eeeb3.mp3", "Tet is a time of family togetherness.": "audio/cau/268732695cf162ce.mp3", "Team games build togetherness.": "audio/cau/a09a1be0bee3a124.mp3", "My grandma told me a funny story.": "audio/cau/f87f67862f96ec79.mp3", "The teacher told us to be quiet.": "audio/cau/42fba1ee1bbe34c4.mp3", "I like swimming, and my sister likes it too.": "audio/cau/695ee0e76ca64b23.mp3", "This tea is too hot; I also want some water.": "audio/cau/641c64a35c7075e8.mp3", "Go straight and turn left at the corner.": "audio/cau/917966b2ec32c8a4.mp3", "A farm can turn food waste into biogas.": "audio/cau/52db34b37521af50.mp3", "This project turns food waste into energy.": "audio/cau/120924f8388b4ad5.mp3", "We turned old bottles into flower pots.": "audio/cau/36df7dee09156ada.mp3", "There is a big TV in our living room.": "audio/cau/12dac61f7442af7c.mp3", "Nam watches TV after dinner, and his television is new.": "audio/cau/f8c696f4133477c5.mp3", "The street looks ugly with all that rubbish.": "audio/cau/84027adc63b4f048.mp3", "The park was ugly before, but now it is beautiful.": "audio/cau/133c40c5a01388aa.mp3", "The new neighbour seems unfriendly.": "audio/cau/0e1c5a5441788b1d.mp3", "Don't be unfriendly to new classmates.": "audio/cau/6506d305aef12ce1.mp3", "The new rule is unpopular with students.": "audio/cau/0273c12663516408.mp3", "This game is unpopular now.": "audio/cau/6dc0deb47558dd88.mp3", "How about + V-ing? How about going to the park?": "audio/cau/4bd32e061c4f1188.mp3", "In the formula, V means a verb, like 'go' or 'play'.": "audio/cau/2a5961c55ebdeb37.mp3", "'Play' is a verb, but 'happy' is not.": "audio/cau/7cb0163f6a27d0af.mp3", "Underline the verb in each sentence.": "audio/cau/c45fa8ec83b8ba93.mp3", "My school is very big and beautiful.": "audio/cau/5cd4ea7091dbf666.mp3", "Thank you very much for your help.": "audio/cau/162955bdaf4118ee.mp3", "Vo Nguyen Giap was a famous Vietnamese general.": "audio/cau/cd884a0a15426a2f.mp3", "Lan speaks Vietnamese and English very well.": "audio/cau/23b99f342f3c3b82.mp3", "The show has many young viewers.": "audio/cau/cb57a4e92d636903.mp3", "Each viewer can vote online.": "audio/cau/022123ae9d507824.mp3", "Millions of viewers watched the match.": "audio/cau/add62fdbb00cba64.mp3", "The programme is popular with viewers.": "audio/cau/f4f1d2c65fa3997b.mp3", "Nam was at home yesterday.": "audio/cau/faca1649a4ef8a76.mp3", "I was tired, but my friends were happy.": "audio/cau/e3e7c2c50296c48e.mp3", "We watch TV after dinner.": "audio/cau/8b47f4f4b321b7f8.mp3", "Nam is watching a film; his new watch is on the table.": "audio/cau/850cc4ddfbc726bf.mp3", "Trang watches films at the cinema at weekends.": "audio/cau/58771fac6bb56dc4.mp3", "My brother likes to watch football, and he watches it every Sunday.": "audio/cau/b5419c83106d199e.mp3", "Lan sings very well.": "audio/cau/8d831f0b90fa91ed.mp3", "Nam plays football well, but Phong plays better.": "audio/cau/7c13b2c077241009.mp3", "We went to the summer camp last June.": "audio/cau/577b7f143e454603.mp3", "Mi usually goes by bus, but yesterday she went by bike.": "audio/cau/bf4b0b541f770b47.mp3", "They were in Ha Noi last year.": "audio/cau/a884324b521a97cd.mp3", "I was at school, and my parents were at work.": "audio/cau/d6c97d0e9f2b3c05.mp3", "Why do you like this book?": "audio/cau/f853b0b3138e4625.mp3", "'Why are you late?' 'Because I missed the bus.'": "audio/cau/c4cf7bd9b30f00fd.mp3", "We had a wonderful holiday.": "audio/cau/b731d7b223c248dd.mp3", "What a wonderful idea!": "audio/cau/83d5b6cb831dd9a7.mp3", "Write the new word in your notebook.": "audio/cau/8b8bb3be1461f910.mp3", "This word has two syllables.": "audio/cau/3c07a10113a0df79.mp3", "Learn five new words every day.": "audio/cau/adb2b8f5372e6050.mp3", "Match the words with the pictures, one word for each picture.": "audio/cau/0c015f99a499421d.mp3", "My parents work in a hospital in Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/4a34bda1f13dc400.mp3", "My uncle is a hard-working worker; he works every day.": "audio/cau/4fe31bc354d9e0c5.mp3", "The worker wears a helmet.": "audio/cau/9c235c7e97cd46ce.mp3", "Factory workers work long hours.": "audio/cau/dd3d0d4cd13eb0b4.mp3", "My mum is working in the garden now.": "audio/cau/0fc0a939dbaf61f1.mp3", "Dad works hard, and today he is working late.": "audio/cau/8fff1884b3def435.mp3", "She was one of the most famous scientists in the world.": "audio/cau/60bcc9b6651e1a00.mp3", "Pho is famous all over the world.": "audio/cau/5cc0d2280fff73e9.mp3", "Their products are sold worldwide.": "audio/cau/33dc1c140e6b7e3c.mp3", "This game is popular all over the world.": "audio/cau/6841bcd23e5d5707.mp3", "Lan's answer was wrong, so she tried again.": "audio/cau/1b25a01594f7e8c8.mp3", "You look sad, Minh. What's wrong?": "audio/cau/bde31146d26c8a31.mp3", "Lie becomes lying: change 'ie' to y and add -ing.": "audio/cau/ccd0d01ed2295121.mp3", "The word 'yellow' begins with the letter y.": "audio/cau/413244207833f8bd.mp3"};
